                  <msItem>
                     <title>Memoranda</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">2 fols. (bifolium), evidently originally blank
                        endleaves, pastedown and flyleaf, from the same manuscript as Harley 315
                        fols. 46, 47 (q.v.). It seems likely that the memoranda are in the hands of
                        Nicholas de Tarent, prior (d. 1309).</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Davis, Medieval cartularies, rev ed. (2010),
                        1045 (but not in any sense a register).</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes"> </note>
                  </msItem>
