                        Benedictine cathedral priory of St Peter, St Paul, and St Swithun</orgName></provenance>
                  <provenance type="MLGB3_laterOwners">At top of the once pasted side (?) Thomas
                     Dackomb (d. c. 1572) wrote a note, in 1558, asking that the manuscript of which
                     these were the endleaves should go to Sheen.</provenance>
